<div class="footnote-footer" id="footnote-657363-1"><a href="javascript:;" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.utils.scrollToReference('footnoteref-657363-1')">1</a>. If it's some magical working, or of ritual significance in the article's context &#8212; I would find that cool! But there isn't any further information, and I'm not comfortable just assuming.</div>
